# curse-no-healing battle setup: Jian and Lucia (third slot empty) in the first Delrich Temple battle with
# strong stats but real HP (100 of 999 each; HP is not pinned), Lucia 300 MP, 5 Healing Gums, curse flag
# 0x33 poked on (the battle sets its own curse flag from it at battle start).
include boot_from_save
pin u16 0x020B464C 0
pin u16 0x020B4650 1
pin u16 0x020B4654 65535
pin u32 0x020B466C 999
pin u8 0x020B4678 255
pin u8 0x020B467C 255
pin u8 0x020B4684 255
pin u8 0x020B468C 255
pin u32 0x020B46C8 999
pin u8 0x020B46D4 255
pin u8 0x020B46D8 255
pin u8 0x020B46E0 255
pin u8 0x020B46E8 255
pin u32 0x020B46D0 300
poke u32 0x020B4668 100
poke u32 0x020B46C4 100
poke u32 0x020B46CC 300
poke u8 0x0213BA43 5
